## Quarto, the next step

::: {style="font-size:30px"}

Quarto is the next step for markdown documentation it preserves the same features of RMarkdown but now including new ones as well as being capable of using it with other programming languages, like python. 

It comes pre-installed inside your RStudio installation. You should be able to create quarto documents following the steps used for RMarkdown, but selecting Quarto Document this time. 

If you open the document you will see is pretty similar to a RMarkdown file, but internally works a litter bit different and has new features that make it more powerful. All the features and functionalities you have learn from RMardown are valid and used in quarto so you already know how to use it.

:::

